			x: 6.0d,
			y: 3.0d,
			title: "The Mason: a Mason's Yard",
			description: ["Build the Mason's Yard, a fenced yard with a stonecutter. A villager without a job takes the stonecutter and becomes a Mason, who cuts the stone, glass and bricks your builders wait for."],
