			y: 5.0d,
			title: "The Tinkerer: a Tinker's Workshop",
			description: ["The Tinkerer has no table of their own: they work at a Smithing Table. Build the Tinker's Workshop, a brick workshop with a smithing table, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding redstone.", "", "They make the redstone and iron parts a build needs, and patch up the village's iron golems. An iron ingot there makes a Toolsmith instead."],
