			x: 6.0d,
			y: 7.0d,
			title: "The Sifter: a Sifting Shed",
			description: ["The Sifter has no table of their own: they work at a Cauldron. Build the Sifting Shed, a timber shed over a cauldron, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding gravel or sand.", "", "They shake loose blocks through a sieve and keep what falls out: slow treasure that never runs out."],
