			x: 6.0d,
			y: -9.0d,
			title: "The Chef: a Kitchen",
			description: ["The Chef has no table of their own: they work at a Smoker. Build the Kitchen, a little house with a smoker, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding raw meat, raw fish or a potato.", "", "Everything they cook goes into the store the villagers eat from. A lead there makes a Butcher instead."],
