			description: ["The Orchard Keeper has no table of their own: they work at a Composter. Build the Berry Farm, a fenced garden of berry bushes with a composter, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding sweet berries, glow berries or an apple.", "", "They pick fruit without cutting the plant, so everything grows back."],
