			description: ["The Florist has no table of their own: they work at a Composter. Build the Flower Shop, a little shop with a composter, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding any flower.", "", "They grow the flowers a village needs: for dyes, for the builders' flower beds and for every empty flower pot."],
