			description: ["The Beekeeper has no table of their own: they work at a Beehive. Build the Apiary Garden, beehives on posts in a meadow, and sneak-right-click a villager by a hive holding a glass bottle or shears.", "", "They harvest every hive round their own, plant flowers and keep the bees breeding."],
