			description: ["The Composter has no table of their own: they work at a Composter. Build the Compost Yard, an open shed with compost bays and a composter, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding bone meal.", "", "They turn the village's scraps into bone meal, and get more out of them than a vanilla composter does."],
